  "details": "I am a world creator and often run into problems that would be fixable if loading other files like images, pdf or txt from a server would fix. sadly right now it is against tos and not implemented into the sdk. the main world i work on is a historical map and i wish to add things like books or descriptions. if i would include every reference image, my world would be way to big to be supported on quest and it would be way too much effort to update everything. it would be cool if we could upload those files to a server and then reference those inside the world, so a certain file will only load for certain people based on network syncing",
